## Recent Highlights

For the latest changes, start with the [most recent release](https://github.com/FOSSBilling/FOSSBilling/releases/latest).

## Breaking Changes

Before updating, review the release notes for any breaking changes or manual follow-up steps. We call these out in each release whenever they apply.

## Security Updates

Security-related changes are also published through our [GitHub security advisories](https://github.com/FOSSBilling/FOSSBilling/security/advisories). If you run FOSSBilling in production, subscribe to release notifications and security alerts.
